VALUES (10, 'south-beach-retro', 'South Beach Retro', 'S', 'Coastal 90s washed corduroy overshirts, graphic tees & vintage surf wear', 'The Workshop / South Beach, Durban', 'Durban', '{"UNISEX","MEN","WOMEN"}', '{"thrift","outerwear"}', 'R 350 - R 750', true, '#D97706', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1596755094514-f87e34085b2c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=85', 17, '29.8587° S, 31.0218° E', true, 'Sun-Drenched Corduroys & 90s Graphic Tees', 'Grade A+ Vintage Mint (Pre-shrunk & Washed)', 'Curating sun-bleached coastal nostalgia from Durban''s surf arcades and beachfront bazaars. Specializing in washed 8-wale corduroy overshirts, rare vintage tour tees, and relaxed warm-climate layering.', '2019', 'Umlazi Mega City Station', '+27 12 345 6789', '', 0.13)
